### STEP 1 - POST register user(keycloak & user_db)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.martinez92@gmail.com",
  "password": "secure1!",
  "phoneCode": "+52",
  "phoneNumber": "6649876543"
}

### STEP 2 - POST access_token info (returns current register_status access token)
POST http://localhost:9090/realms/bank/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password
&client_id=kong
&client_secret=kong-client-secret
&username=ana.martinez92@gmail.com
&password=secure1!

### PUT update profile
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/user/register/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{register_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "names": "Ana",
  "firstSurname": "Martinez",
  "secondSurname": "Lopez",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "birthday": "15/06/1992",
  "countryOfBirth": "MX"
}

### PUT update kyc
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/user/register/me/kyc
Authorization: Bearer {{register_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "curp": "MALA920615MSLRPN09",
  "rfc": "MALA920615AB3",
  "documentType": "NATIONAL_ID_CARD"
}

### PUT update financial info (optional)
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/user/register/me/financial
Authorization: Bearer {{register_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "occupationType": "EMPLOYEE",
  "employerName": "Tech Company SA de CV",
  "incomeSource": "SALARY",
  "monthlyIncome": 25000.00,
  "maritalStatus": "SINGLE"
}

### POST get access token(ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:9090/realms/bank/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password
&client_id=kong
&client_secret=kong-client-secret
&username=admin@bank.com
&password=admin123
